        "at much larger ones; that was not measured. Nothing here is a claim "
        "about biology, and there is no surrogate model and no rendered frame "
        "rate in this repository at all -- those are refused, not estimated.",
  ),
    Claim(
        "cgga_ood_transport_is_measured_not_asserted",
        "The five proposed online-only pipelines were bound to data rather than "
        "to figure captions. CGGA's clinical releases download without a login "
        "and are cached; with the repository's own Cox model -- age, sex and a "
        "glioblastoma dummy, fitted once on the cached TCGA cohort (n=595, 491 "
