    Claim(
        "solver_portability_is_measured_and_cross_cancer_generalization_is_refused",
        "Tissue portability is measured, and cross-cancer prediction is "
        "refused. The solver's entire tissue/drug surface is five dataclasses "
        "-- TumorGeometry, CloneParams, DrugParams, ImmuneParams and "
        "DiffusionField, 23 fields in total, introspected live -- and the "
        "unmodified engine runs a deliberately non-brain phantom (a lobulated "
        "ellipsoid with uniform proliferation and no necrotic-core structure, "
